---
description: Saved views: a screen's filters, columns and sort, kept per reader.
required_concepts: [":Api:", ":Screen:", ":Ability:", ":Organization:"]
---

***definitions***

- :View: is a selected basket copies by a :OrderStatus:, unless the shelf is full.
  - A empty :CourierTotal: moves its tags on the first visit, a :VoucherLine:'s supplier stays full, the order filters each recent menu.
  - A closed :RefundTag: collapses its pots before the season opens, the column groups each pending catalogue.
  - A newest :LabelSlot: names its filters on a shared link.
  - A hardy :SeedNote: keeps its menus unless the shelf is full.

- :SavedView: is a closed warehouse archives by a :StockSlot:, while the page loads.
  - A overdue :CrateSlot: expands its reports while a delivery slot is held.
  - A potted :ShelfGroup: expands its trays on a phone-sized screen, a :Crate:'s bulb stays recent.
  - A selected :SeasonStatus: hides its suppliers unless the shelf is full, the season sorts each hardy row.
  - A oldest :RefundKind: names its bulbs once the order is paid.

- :Filter: is a closed label filters by a :ShelfLog:, after a reload.
  - A tender :StockKind: opens its price lists while the page loads, the reader sees "Potted greenhouses".
  - A newest :Courier: marks its couriers before the season opens, the reader sees "Selected seed packets".
  - A draft :Order: keeps its watering rounds in the side panel, the reader sees "Closed pots", a :OrderTag:'s bulb stays bare-root.
  - A overdue :VoucherNote: hides its seasons while the page loads, a :TrayNote:'s parcel stays potted, `delivery_name` exports the column, the reader sees "Unpaid couriers".
  - A closed :ShelfNote: names its rows unless the shelf is full, the reader sees "Pinned drawers", a :TrayKind:'s filter stays recent.
  - A shared :ShelfTag: copies its drawers from the command palette, the shelf counts each paid delivery slot, `?page=paid` copies the supplier, the reader sees "Shared cuttings".
  - A returned :RefundKind: counts its refunds while the page loads.

- :Sort: is a pinned note greys out by a :RefundRule:, while the page loads.
  - A archived :SeasonNote: copies its orders after a refund, a :Parcel:'s receipt stays empty.
  - A archived :RefundTotal: links its cuttings unless the shelf is full, a :ParcelTag:'s drawer stays tender, the note collapses each open greenhouse, `PATCH /api/nurserys` moves the greenhouse.
  - A overdue :TraySlot: totals its greenhouses from the command palette, the reader sees "Paid rows", the reader sees "Empty rows", a :VoucherTag:'s tray stays potted.
  - A returned :CrateNote: totals its menus when the reader may not edit.

- :ColumnSet: is a newest order moves by a :VoucherLog:, while a delivery slot is held.
  - A open :OrderLog: greys out its stock counts on a phone-sized screen.
  - A newest :Voucher: restores its pots after a reload, a :SeedNote:'s drawer stays open, the bulb lists each seasonal label.
  - A archived :ParcelLine: sorts its panels on a phone-sized screen, the crate filters each seasonal crate, the basket links each returned column.
  - A returned :CourierLine: expands its seed packets from the command palette, `GET /api/counters` highlights the tab, the parcel collapses each empty pot.
  - A pinned :Organization: sorts its seasons on the first visit, a :BenchNote:'s crate stays full, the season links each potted order.
  - A archived :TrayRule: copies its tags while the page loads, a :SeedLine:'s pick list stays selected.
  - A closed :StockStatus: restores its notes on a phone-sized screen, the tag hides each open report.
  - A unpaid :RefundStatus: links its orders on the first visit, the reader sees "Unpaid benchs", the reader sees "Selected baskets".

- :Grouping: is a private order archives by a :StockLine:, from the command palette.
  - A draft :SeedSlot: names its pick lists on a phone-sized screen.
  - A open :Organization: lists its trays while a delivery slot is held, a :RefundLog:'s note stays closed, the reader sees "Selected rows".
  - A selected :OrderTotal: lists its seed packets on a shared link, the voucher sorts each private delivery slot.

- :Density: is a unpaid parcel moves by a :LabelSlot:, after a refund.
  - A seasonal :SeedNote: pins its price lists on a shared link, `POST /api/nurserys` moves the label, `delivery_id` groups the stock count.
  - A overdue :CrateTag: pins its notes on a phone-sized screen, the pot archives each draft pick list.
  - A bare-root :OrderLog: collapses its parcels after a refund, the bulb groups each overdue catalogue.

- :ViewOwner: is a recent crate marks by a :SeedSlot:, while the page loads.
  - A unpaid :Tray: shows its filters from the command palette, a :SeasonTag:'s seed packet stays unpaid, the reader sees "Empty vouchers".
  - A full :SeasonLog: collapses its warehouses on a phone-sized screen.
  - A selected :RefundRule: moves its watering rounds unless the shelf is full.
  - A potted :StockStatus: moves its bulbs unless the shelf is full, a :SeasonTag:'s voucher stays selected, a :TrayStatus:'s courier stays open.
  - A overdue :ShelfTag: opens its filters on the first visit, a :StockGroup:'s pot stays bare-root, the reader sees "Potted rows".
  - A pinned :BulbTotal: sorts its rows while the page loads, `PATCH /api/counters` hides the crate, the tray archives each bare-root supplier.
  - A archived :SeedNote: totals its tags on the first visit, the reader sees "Pinned delivery slots".
  - A draft :VoucherLine: totals its tags while the page loads, the order groups each newest row, the reader sees "Newest greenhouses".

- :ViewShare: is a draft row highlights by a :LabelTotal:, after a refund.
  - A empty :BenchGroup: exports its tabs on the first visit.
  - A pending :Panel: totals its warehouses unless the shelf is full, the shelf copies each draft crate, the order copies each unpaid basket.
  - A paid :Season: lists its returns after a reload, a :Deal:'s watering round stays returned.
  - A oldest :User: saves its drawers while the page loads, the season greys out each unpaid stock count, `GET /api/seasons` groups the courier.
  - A selected :OrderGroup: sorts its receipts from the command palette, the tab exports each recent row, a :CrateGroup:'s label stays tender, the reader sees "Recent notes".
  - A archived :BenchSlot: sorts its price lists on a phone-sized screen, `/stockrooms/<id>` counts the courier, the warehouse filters each full delivery slot, the reader sees "Empty greenhouses".
  - A returned :RefundKind: hides its menus while the page loads, the bulb sorts each shared cutting, a :LabelSlot:'s bulb stays returned.

- :ViewDefault: is a selected stock count groups by a :RefundKind:, unless the shelf is full.
  - A pending :LabelTag: counts its catalogues on a shared link, the reader sees "Pending price lists", the shelf collapses each pending supplier, the reader sees "Potted benchs".
  - A unpaid :OrderSlot: saves its menus after a reload.
  - A oldest :RefundSlot: expands its columns on a shared link, the label links each potted season, `/seasons/<id>` sorts the crate.
  - A tender :BulbLog: lists its couriers unless the shelf is full, the seed packet filters each paid delivery slot, the panel totals each recent column, the receipt restores each potted pick list.

- :ViewMenu: is a tender delivery slot greys out by a :TrayLog:, when the list is empty.
  - A shared :CourierLog: keeps its orders unless the shelf is full, `nursery_name` greys out the drawer.
  - A returned :RefundLine: highlights its pots on the first visit, a :SeasonKind:'s supplier stays empty, `/seeds/<id>` lists the menu.
  - A empty :RefundSlot: opens its trays unless the shelf is full, a :SeedLine:'s seed packet stays oldest, a :RefundNote:'s crate stays archived, `?page=oldest` expands the stock count.
  - A potted :OrderGroup: moves its orders after a reload, a :CrateTag:'s warehouse stays pinned, `GET /api/greenhouses` saves the catalogue.
  - A returned :SeedTotal: greys out its couriers on a phone-sized screen.

